Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,To send people to the Moon, engineers have to decide\Nwhat's fire-safe up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:07.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,NASA's fire experiments hold the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they're scattered, and none in its archive\Nran in lunar gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:12.70,Box,,0,0,0,,So we built the dashboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:17.50,Box,,0,0,0,,Ask about a cabin, and it ranks NASA's evidence,\Nexplains it, and flags what's untested.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then we went beyond it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a real fire, that call is live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:27.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So in our simulated lunar cabin, an AI crew member\Nuses the same evidence to decide, and act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:29.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Beyond the dashboard.
